{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"62fbcd1ec18db2344469b1c81764c86e085386c88758400a6fe123b1d81657d5","ja":"登山の最終試練……！","zh":"登山的最终试炼……！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"2a16189f6d6759dc548f6f3e399d0d5ef233ffc94273733994366e8a9b6eb1a1","ja":"なにこれ！？　パスタの中に、\nおっきなミートボールがいっぱい！","zh":"这是什么啊！？意大利面里，\n有好多好大的肉丸！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f4fbfa71afa9d94cda3fe8cea4305a98f0e69e10a9afffc096aa259fd5dfaa4e","ja":"「ついにお目見えしました！　これが最後の難関、\n特製チーズ入りミートボールの土台だー！」","zh":"“终于登场了！这就是最后的难关，\n特制芝士肉丸的底座——！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"52da3d301239acaea6904f87be80e8b8d70567a255bd7066199d3077cac33260","ja":"ううっ、さすがにここからお肉は厳しいヨ……。","zh":"呜呜，接下来还要吃肉果然还是吃不下了啦……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"4c0020fbe6862d3c41b3b3dbc621984c072ce1f0df7073f12fc69213bc636894","ja":"でも、これを食べきったら、完食に一気に近づくよ！\nもう少しだけ、頑張ろう！","zh":"不过，只要把这个吃完，离吃光就更进一步了！\n再加把劲吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"34a5b33ff0a9a5c9b8f77906fa417bd9f26282cf7ca60b74d37ee60f3ac8d489","ja":"開始から40分後……","zh":"开始40分钟后……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"a67bbe74bd58f223de238add596a5fcd1eacc82c474dee901ebc227cb628da75","ja":"アタシ、も、もうダメ。\nこ、これ以上、お腹に入んない～……。","zh":"我、已、已经不行了。\n肚、肚子已经塞不下了～……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"b685cc94ff49634d7adab5f194005685139365edda6e07d2a00fe5343a746dec","ja":"みんな、ごめんなさい。\n私も、もう……ギブアップ……。","zh":"大家，对不起。\n我也已经……撑不下去了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"1e84a165b5cc6a83101f10ccecbb1dfff3fcfcba38ea9557f3bd2cfc671ec6ea","ja":"私も、お腹いっぱい……\nごちそうさまでした……。","zh":"我也吃饱了……\n多谢款待……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[37].text","source_sha256":"f616b16f75da4994de9acd2d52a15a84a38457eefc9330bf415f8f17d9a244f7","ja":"あともうちょっとだけど……ワタシも、もう無理。\nこのままじゃ、チャレンジ失敗だネ……。","zh":"虽然只差一点了……但我也不行了。\n这样下去，挑战就要失败了呢……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"e1959dbae5f7b43b1333ceaf635e5830c63e7721bdcc97d788e97ea87acb00b3","ja":"安心してください！　残りは私が全部食べちゃいます！\nこれくらいの量なら、ギリギリいけるはず……！","zh":"请放心吧！剩下的我全都会吃掉的！\n这种程度的分量，勉强应该还能吃得下……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"7f4851c57b0e86c2b216d507d5f70997cf135014c2a36e0059e13089202a22c3","ja":"「おーっと、矢吹さんがラストスパート！\nだが残り時間はわずか！　間に合うか～！」","zh":"“哎呀～，矢吹同学开始最后的冲刺！\n但所剩时间已经无几！究竟赶不赶得上呢～！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[53].text","source_sha256":"efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e","ja":"そして……","zh":"然后……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:59:02+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[54].text","source_sha256":"dbb279b92d3413a5c1180df786d8ea1a982690a0be3372bbd3b013d092386174","ja":"……ふぅ。ご馳走様でした～っ！","zh":"……呼。多谢款待～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[55].text","source_sha256":"bff9817721a45346b31d6ff906b7b72082bfac4f2d9abeaddb09217631f820ea","ja":"やった～っ！　本当に食べきっちゃった！\n可奈、すごいすごーい！","zh":"太棒啦～！真的全都吃完了！\n可奈，太厉害太厉害啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[56].text","source_sha256":"686aaa424fda9be87fd1eb838369824f27d6d0851d095a222cdd95f1453e2f5e","ja":"「登頂成功、おめでとうございます！\nそれでは、お気の済むまで宣伝をどうぞ！」","zh":"“恭喜成功登顶！\n那么，请尽情宣传吧！”","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[57].text","source_sha256":"ce9dfe2dc672002000c2ea36c6302a1c2a5b0a0b839983fb57e406a49d4e802f","ja":"はいっ！　765プロライブ劇場では、\n『STARDOM ROAD』の公演が続いています。","zh":"好的！　在765事务所的剧场里，\n“STARDOM ROAD”的公演正在持续进行中。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1459.unity3d","item_key":"commands[58].text","source_sha256":"d5f1a394f7a462b49e8b78513621e1d556b207bf38c274a4158db8be8b5ee3c8","ja":"同じ役を様々なアイドルが演じる面白い公演なので、\n765プロライブ劇場へ、足を運んでみてください！","zh":"因为是由形形色色的偶像出演同一个角色的有趣公演，\n请务必前往765LIVE剧场看看哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:26:03+00:00"}
